          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 115251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen bir dizi değerini tek bir değere dönüştürmemiz gerekir. Örneğin, bir toplam hesaplamak istediğimizde.</p><p>Bunu yapmanın klasik bir yolu döngü kullanmaktır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" total += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>total</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen bir dizi değerini tek bir değere dönüştürmemiz gerekir. Örneğin, bir toplam hesaplamak istediğimizde.</p><p>Bunu yapmanın klasik bir yolu döngü kullanmaktır. Kodun <code>207</code> yazdırması için değişen toplamın güncellenmesini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" total += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"miles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>element</code>, ardından <code>total</code> ve son olarak <code>+=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Calling .reduce on an Array",
            "id": 115252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ancak JavaScript daha basit ve zaten mevcut olan bir metot sunar. <code>.reduce()</code>, satır içi bir fonksiyon kullanarak dizi değerlerini tek bir değerde birleştirebilir.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> şu söz dizimini kullanır: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Şimdi bunu <code>miles</code> dizisi üzerinde nasıl çağırabileceğimize bakalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"        \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>miles</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ancak JavaScript daha basit ve zaten mevcut olan bir metot sunar. <code>.reduce()</code>, satır içi bir fonksiyon kullanarak dizi değerlerini tek bir değerde birleştirebilir.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> şu söz dizimini kullanır: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Bu metot çağrısını <code>miles</code> üzerinde oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"filter\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>miles</code>, ardından <code>.</code>, <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Functions",
            "id": 115253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerlerin nasıl birleştirileceğini <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna anlatmak için önce bir fonksiyonu parametre olarak geçirmemiz gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerlerin nasıl birleştirileceğini <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna anlatmak için önce bir fonksiyonu parametre olarak geçirmemiz gerekir.</p><p><code>reduce()</code> tarafından alınan boş geri çağırma fonksiyonunu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 115255,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonumuzun iki parametreye ihtiyacı var: ilki önceki <strong>indirgeme</strong> işleminin sonucuna, ikincisi ise mevcut değere erişmek için.</p><p>Şu iki parametreyi, bu sırayla ekle: <code>prev</code> ve <code>curr</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>prev,</code>, ardından <code>curr</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 115254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code>, bir dizi üzerinde yineleme yapar ve her değerde, tek bir değere ulaşana kadar iki parametreyle bir işlem gerçekleştirir.</p><p>Örneğin, değerleri toplamak için satır içi fonksiyon, <code>prev</code> indirgemesinin ve <code>curr</code> değerinin toplamını döndürür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>prev + curr</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code>, bir dizi üzerinde yineleme yapar ve her değerde, tek bir değere ulaşana kadar iki parametreyle bir işlem gerçekleştirir.</p><p>Örneğin, değerleri toplamak için satır içi fonksiyon, <code>prev</code> indirgemesinin ve <code>curr</code> değerinin toplamını döndürür.</p><p>İlk parametreyi <code>prev</code>, ikinciyi ise <code>curr</code> olarak adlandır.</p><p>Kodun <code>207</code> yazdırması için bu return ifadesini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>prev</code>, ardından <code>curr</code>, <code>return</code> ve son olarak <code>+</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow functions",
            "id": 115258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimimizi basitleştirmek için satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir JavaScript ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(prevVal, currVal)</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>prevVal + currVal</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimimizi basitleştirmek için satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir JavaScript ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz.</p><p>Parametreleri bu sırayla <code>prevVal</code> ve <code>currVal</code> olarak adlandır.</p><p><code>prevVal</code> değerini sola, <code>currVal</code> değerini sağa yerleştir. Toplamın <code>207</code> olması için operatörü seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" miles = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = miles.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"207\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>prevVal</code>, ardından <code>currVal</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prevVal</code>, <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>currVal</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters II",
            "id": 115256,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona üçüncü bir parametre eklersen her yinelemenin indeksine de erişebilirsin.</p><p>Bu örnekte, <code>prices</code> değerlerini toplamak için <code>.reduce()</code> metodunu kullanıyoruz; ancak ikinci bir diziden indirim faktörü uygulamak için <code>index</code> değerini de dahil ediyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discountFactor = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * discountFactor[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"214\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81.625\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>index</code>, ardından <code>index</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyona üçüncü bir parametre eklersen her yinelemenin indeksine de erişebilirsin.</p><p>Bu örnekte <code>prices</code> değerlerini toplamak için <code>.reduce()</code> kullanıyoruz, ayrıca <code>index</code> değerini de ekliyoruz.</p><p>İkinci bir diziden indirim çarpanı uygular. Kodun <code>81.625</code> yazdırması için dizine dayalı aramayı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discountFactor = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * discountFactor[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prices\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"prevVal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"currVal\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"81.625\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>discountFactor</code>, ardından <code>index</code> ve son olarak <code>index</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
